window.products.push({"id":564097,"name":"UniLiGis Washable Laundry Bag with Strap, Laundry Backpack with Drawstring, Combined Use of Laundry Basket or Clothes Hamper, Can Hold 3 Loads of Laun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OvXAUzjEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Nylon LARGER Capacity & DURABLE Material– UniLiGis Laundry Bag with Special Round bottom design holds more clothes(almost 3 loads of laundry each) ,easy to stand for putting stuff in. Laundry bag in durable nylon material with double-seam of stiching, although with 70 L capacity, you would never worry too much clothes would tear the bag apart. These Liners are MACHINE WASHABLE. Size: Diameter 15in x 27 H in( Dia 38 x 68H cm). ADJUSTABLE STRAP for EASY TRANSPORT - These Laundry Bag Backpack is very thoughtful to have this ADJUSTABLE shoulder strap in this laundry liners pack, which meets different requirements from different height. Feel free to ADJUST length of strap to make you comfortable during your laundry TRANSPORTATION. Use as a HANGING HAMPER -Many people wonder if this laundry bags with strap could be hang in somewhere, well let me tell you this, we offer an extra hanger on the tops of bags, as long as you have a hood, you can just hang on a hook, and it's all ready for dirty clothes collecting. Super practical and space saving. Drawstring CLOSURE for SAFETY- Keep all your belongings in confidential with double side drawstring closure in laundry bag backpack. That's never gonna happen something like split out clothes. MULTI-PURPOSE storage bag – heavy duty laundry bag backpack with shoulder strap would be your best choice not only for laundry transportation and home use storage of seasonal clothes, bedding,toys and blankets, but also a good helper to used for travelling,summer camping, hiking or others, folding as small as your palm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OvXAUzjEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UniLiGis","source_asin":"B07W77XZXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-564097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W77XZXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W77XZXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":564098,"name":"Fresh Elm Tea Infuser Set - 3 Loose Leaf Tea Strainers - Stainless Steel + Perfect for Cup, Mug or Teapot + Free Drip Tray!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y-N5tkKLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Look no further than this Stainless Steel Loose Leaf Tea Infuser Set for the right tools to steep and filter tea to your liking! No more being stuck with a tea ball that is too small for your large mug or that is not fit for use with very fine tea leaves. This is the best tea infuser set because it gives you the correct tools for any situation. This works great as the perfect gift for the holidays, a housewarming or just your favorite tea drinker. Each Set includes: 2 Long Handled Tea Infusers -Versatile and perfect for short or taller drinking containers -7\" long with a tea ball diameter of 2\" -Not suitable for ultra fine tea leaves 1 Basket Style Tea Infuser -Perfect for short to medium-sized cups or mugs -Great to filter various tea types (including ultra fine tea leaves) -2\"x1.8\" with a 4.5\" hook and chain 1 Bonus Drip Tray to avoid spills and keep your tea steeping area clean! Instructions: Long Handled Tea Infuser: Push the handle in to open the tea ball. Place your preferred amount of tea inside and release the handle to close the ball. Place the tea ball into your preferred container with the desired amount of hot water and drink when ready. Basket Style Tea Infuser: Twist the cap on the basket to remove. Place your preferred amount of tea inside. Replace the cap on the basket and twist until it locks. Place the basket into your preferred container with the desired amount of hot water. Attach the hook at the end of the chain to the rim of your cup and drink when ready.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y-N5tkKLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fresh Elm","source_asin":"B01M59R3PP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-564098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M59R3PP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M59R3PP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
