window.products.push({"id":564190,"name":"Triangle Germany Fish Scaler, Professional-grade Design with Scale Catcher, Quadruple-edged Serrated Blade, Dishwasher Safe Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pLjj7zo+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Marketed worldwide, TRIANGLE Germany stands for high-quality and functional kitchen tools for professional chefs and ambitious home cooks Ideal for removing fish scales of all sizes, the TRIANGLE Germany Fish Scaler includes a quadruple-edged serrated blade (4 different tooth patterns on 1 blade) versatile enough to span a wide range of fish. Equipped with a stainless steel catcher to collect the removed scales, kitchens and work spaces stay clean and tidy. Boasting a versatile, professional-grade design, the TRIANGLE Germany Fish Scaler features premium durable stainless steel and sharp blades to efficiently extract scales from fish without damaging delicate skin. Used by chefs worldwide, a seamlessly fit, lightweight polypropylene handle prevents steel from bending and facilitates simple maneuvering and maximum control. The TRIANGLE Germany Fish Scaler measures 9-1/2\" long with a 3\" wide removable blade for easy cleaning. Food and dishwasher safe. Imported. In 1946, Erwin Hill founded \"Hill Metal Fabrication\" and started manufacturing rotary whisks from a patented design. Over the years, the product range increased, encompassing a wide range of kitchen tools, and the TRIANGLE brand was registered in 2002. Working closely with local partners in Solingen, Germany, to deliver excellent on-the-job stainless steel manufacturing, Triangle is a third-generation family-owned company committed to quality, functionality and sustainable production.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pLjj7zo+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"triangle","source_asin":"B07DR3YZK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-564190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DR3YZK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DR3YZK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
