window.products.push({"id":564262,"name":"Meat Thermometer Digital, SOQOOL Instant Read Food Thermometers for Kitchen Cooking with Probe, Backlight, Magnet, Waterproof, for Candy, Grill BBQ, O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Uomp-AZxL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ultra Fast & Accurate Readout】 Equipped with a food grade stainless long probe, thermometer takes the temperature in a little as 2-3 seconds and is accurate to ±1°C(1.8℉) degrees with a wide range of -58℉~572℉（-50°C~300°C). The food thermometer is perfect for indoor/outdoor cooking, grilling, BBQ and more. No matter what you're cooking, this instant read meat thermometer is the best assistant for you. 【Convenient to Use & Multi Function】Works right out the box! The digital thermometer is pre-calibrated, so you don't need to calibrate by yourself. With Auto On/Off function, you can unfold the probe to turn on or fold to turn off. Press the ℃/℉ button to switch the temperature between Centigrade and Fahrenheit. The digital meat thermometer not only comes with a large digital LCD backlight screen, but also has Hold Button which lets you see the temp easier. 【Waterproof Design & Durable Material】 With professional IP67 rated waterproof design, the SOQOOL food thermometer can be washed under running water without fear! Incredible waterproof performance makes it easier to clean. What's more, the meat thermometer has a strong ABS plastic shell. Even if the thermometer is accidentally dropped or hit, it can be easily protected from serious damage. SOQOOL thermometer works with great durability and lasts longer than others. 【Built-in Magnet & Easy Storage】The instant read thermometer has built-in magnet and a hanging hole with bottle opener function. After cooking finished, you can either hook the food thermometer to the wall or attach its magnetic back to the refrigerator or oven within your reach. The meat thermometer is easy to store. Whether refrigerator, oven, kitchen hook or other places, it can be easily stored wherever you want. 【Lifetime Hassle-free Support】SOQOOL Team provides all of our customer's high-quality products and professional after-sales service. If you have any problems, please feel free to reach to us and one-click \"contact the seller\". We will be here for you 24-7-365. SOQOOL instant read food thermometer makes an essential for your kitchen gadget. Order now and say hello to perfectly cooked steak, turkey or BBQ.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Uomp-AZxL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soqool","source_asin":"B0BFB64MM7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-564262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFB64MM7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFB64MM7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
