window.products.push({"id":564392,"name":"Gifbera 4-Tier Round Acrylic Cake Cupcake Stand - Luxury Birthday Wedding Party Dessert Display Tower Holder with Base and Flower Cut-Outs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612-ahZK+8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gifbera 4 Tiers Cupcake and Dessert display Tower Stand Round with Base / Beautiful Flower Cut-Out Individually decorated cupcakes are the perfect way to add a personal touch to celebrations. Now, with Luxury Gifbera Acrylic Cupcake stands, you have the perfect way to serve them.  You can create a stunning display of cakes for any setting-showers, kids' birthdays, weddings, holidays, graduation and anniversary parties with this elegant towering tiers stand. Just bake, ice and core your cakes, then assemble with the columns and plates. Can also be used to display cupcakes and you can use just 2, 3 or up to all 4 plates. FEATURES A truly elegant way to display your cake and cupcake creations, perfect for wedding party, kids' birthday, christening, bridal shower, anniversary prom, etc.  This cake stand holder is made of Food Grade, Non-toxic, Clear-finished Acrylic for safty . Cake stand includes base, base feet, 4 plates, 4 posts, screws  Assembly required; Each plates can be detachable, you can assemble the tiers according your own preferences.  Plates hold 7.5'' (19cm), 9'' (23cm), 10.5'' (27cm) and 12'' (31cm) cakes; Plate thickness 0.15'' (4mm), 4.5'' between tiers and tower stands 15.2'' (35.6 cm) when fully assembled STABILITY UPGRADE - 4mm plates instead of 3mm or 2mm thickness and base with feet, which can hold around 12 pounds cupcake, dessert, pastry or food.  PACKAGE - Customized carton for per unit,completely protect every plates of the whole cake stand,you don't need to be aware of damage when shipping,also we have good after sale service,we'd like to hear every client's suggestion or complaints and we fix all for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612-ahZK+8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GiFBERA","source_asin":"B07KR4BK33","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-564392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KR4BK33","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KR4BK33","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":564393,"name":"2-ounce Moscow Mule Copper Shot Glass - Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h846tRPQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Moscow Mule vodka cocktail is making a big comeback in bars and at parties across the country, and everyone instantly recognizes the iconic copper mug that the drink is served in as a result. The Decodyne Mini Moscow Mule Mugs bring the look of the classic Moscow Mule mug to life in a whole new way that will have your guests at your next party raving! The Decodyne Mini Moscow Mule Mugs look just like conventional Moscow Mule mugs with their copper exteriors and contoured brass handles, but at 2 ounces in size, they hold as much alcohol as a classic shot glass. Perfect for serving chilled vodka shots, these mini mugs are a stylish alternative to plain old glass shot glasses and can double as a decorative item when you're not entertaining. Compared to other mini Moscow Mule mugs on the market today, the mug shot glasses included in the Decodyne Mini Moscow Mule Mugs are truly of superior quality. Our mini mugs are made out of stainless steel, which won't corrode or tarnish like solid copper and is safer for the skin that the nickel lining used in other mugs. To keep the polished copper-plated surface of our mugs looking lustrous, we finish it with a tarnish resistant clear lacquer. Ultra durable, our mini mugs can be used again and again and are easy to clean with nothing but a damp cloth. Sold in a set of two, the Decodyne Mini Moscow Mule Mugs are great for entertaining in your own home but can also make a unique gift. Give a set as wedding gifts, housewarming gifts, Father's Day gifts, groomsmen gifts or barware gifts for any other occasion!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h846tRPQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decodyne","source_asin":"B0147LLSCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-564393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0147LLSCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0147LLSCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
