window.products.push({"id":564419,"name":"MALOUF STEELOCK Headboard-Footboard Hook-in Super Duty Steel Wedge Lock Metal Bed Frame - Functions as Bed Rails - Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bPlFERYJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Support your mattress with the sturdiest bed frame design available. The unique wedge lock connectors become stronger as more weight is applied and can support virtually any practical weight. The bed frame assembles easily in seconds with absolutely no tools. Features a lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects and workmanship. The six adjustable height glides allow fine tuned height matching and stabilizing. The center support bar is 2-1/2\" wide and made from double rail angle iron. Side rails with protective end caps and cross arms are both 1-1/2\" x 1-1/2\". Extra wide construction offset to fit virtually all headboards. Deeply recessed legs provide extra toe room and prevent foot injury. Powder coated in a stylish black matte. Available in Cal King, King, Queen, Full and Twin configurations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bPlFERYJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALOUF","source_asin":"B00ISAM4YE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-564419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ISAM4YE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ISAM4YE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":564420,"name":"Zak Designs Kids' Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Food Jar with Carry Handle, Thermal Container for Travel Meals and Lunch On The Go, 12 oz, Toy Stor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oo84eNVNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This insulated, stainless steel food jar makes taking meals on the go fun for any Disney and Pixar fan! Durable Materials The container is made from 18/8 stainless steel, which is food grade quality, BPA free, and sturdy enough to stand up to everyday wear and tear. Vacuum Insulation The thermal container has vacuum insulation that keeps hot food hot and cold food cold, so once you pack up a meal, it stays the perfect temperature until it's time to eat. The double-wall construction also prevents condensation from forming on the outer walls, eliminating messy water rings. Leak-Proof Lid The lid screws on tightly and won't leak when it's securely closed, so the food jar can go into a lunch box or bag without worry. It also has a built-in handle for improved grip, making it easy to carry by hand. Spec. 12 oz capacity. Made of food-grade, 18/8 stainless steel. BPA-Free - Zak is committed to safety. Hand wash to preserve vacuum seal, do not microwave. Length: 3.38-inch, Width: 3.38-inch, Height: 6.07-inch. Character: Buzz Lightyear, Woody, Jessie, Bullseye, Rex, Alien (Disney and Pixar's Toy Story 4).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oo84eNVNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B0BGSG4YTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-564420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGSG4YTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGSG4YTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
