window.products.push({"id":564607,"name":"Boho Kitchen Rug Runner 2.3'x5.3' Small Bathroom Rugs with Tassels,Black Moroccan Farmhouse Cotton Bath Mat Woven Chic Cute Throw Rug Washable for Hal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OxNvwOzvL._AC_SL1118_.jpg","description":"When it comes to home decor, there’s nothing quite like a unique bohemian rug to make a bold statement. Or a more subtle one, if you prefer the boho kitchen sink rug isone of the best ways to bring a bedroom, living room, or even dining room space together and make your interior design shine.If you’re intrigued by the ideaof adding a touch of boho to your home,a moroccan rug is a great way to add color and style to a room. Yarn-dyed Process Style Your Room:This collection includes contemporary Yarn-dyed designs & trendy boho themes for in- & even outdoor use. White woven rug with blackyarn geometric pattern.Black woven rug with white yarn geometric pattern.small plush yarn tufted woven on the boho runner rug adds exquisite detail and craftsmanship.High-quality workmanship, the fabric is thick, durably designed for long-lasting life. Don’t worry, the yarn tufts are hand-woven and won’t fall off at will. Theindoor outdoor rug will not deform and fade easily PRODUCTS DESCRIPTION Fabric：45% cotton +45% polyester +10% viscose pets and kids Friendly, Technics：Hand Knotted, Handmade, Woven Size：2'x3', 2'x4.3',2.3'x5.3',3'x5', 4'x6',5x7ft Usage:kitchen,guest bathroom,guest bedroom,front door entryway,fireplace,sink,hallway, under counter stools,in front of the tub,entrance,living room,laundry,patio,dining room,entrance,porch.. Washing instruction: Machine wash the small rug in a mesh bag with gentle water,do not bleach.Lay flat to dry. Hand wash can extend usage time Tips 1:Size excludes the tassel: 2'x3', 2'x4.3',2.3'x5.3' feet.Each side tassel is about 3.1 - 3.9 inches Size not exclude the tassel:3'x5', 4'x6',5x7feet. TIP 2:The back of the black and white bathroom rug without non-slip bottom,highly recommend match with slip grip for the bottom Tips 3:you can sit on your front porch under a welcome mat for a layered effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OxNvwOzvL._AC_SL1118_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uyi Grip","source_asin":"B096X96CPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-564607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096X96CPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096X96CPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
