window.products.push({"id":564643,"name":"7 Pcs Bamboo and Plastic Bathroom Accessories Sets, Includes Toothbrush Cup, Toothbrush Holder, Soap Dispenser, Soap Dish, Toilet Brush with Holder, T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T6JEerfbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ARE YOU TIRED OF YOUR MESSY BATHROOM? There is a practical bathroom kit consisting of 7 items, namely a trash can, a toilet brush with bracket, a soap dish, a lotion dispenser, a mouthwash cup, a toothbrush holder, and 3 toothbrushes. Our plastic bathroom accessory set has integrate function with decoration with a compact appearance, and comes with all the necessary accessories to keep the bathroom dresser or countertop neat and orderly! 1. Trash Can It is a small trash bin with a cover which is specially designed for small spaces. There is enough space in the trash can to put makeup remover cotton and cotton swab stick trash. You can drop litter as long as you press it down gently. Such trash cans are suitable for bathrooms, bedrooms, and kitchens. 2.Toilet Brush with Holder The brush head can reach deep to clean the pipe more effectively and reach the corners and gaps of the toilet to clean up the annoying filth. The toilet brush comes with a stand, which is convenient for storage and tidying and easy to maintain the tidiness of the bathroom. 3. Soapdish The leaky design keeps your soap dry, not easy to be melted by water. Beautiful and practical, it is suitable to contain various perfumed and laundry soaps. 4. Lotion Dispenser Perfect for shampoo, conditioner, lotion, body wash, or face wash, easy to use. ABS plastic plated silver indenter. It can be pressed by one hand and rebound automatically to press the pump. 5. Toothbrush Holder There are holes in the cover of the toothbrush holder, which can store toothbrushes, razors, combs separately. 6. Toothbrush Cup Made of durable plastic, can be used with other bathroom accessories. 7. Bamboo charcoal soft toothbrush Equipped with 3 wide-head soft bristles toothbrushes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T6JEerfbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DGDFLDGC","source_asin":"B0BD8RHL5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-564643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD8RHL5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD8RHL5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
